  "id": "consultee",
  "term": "consultee",
  "definition": "A consultee is a family member who is asked to help with decisions about research participation for an adult who lacks the capacity to consent. In this role, the consultee acts as an alternative proxy decision-maker and may need information and support to make an informed choice.",
